  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - needs TestFramework.Core 0.7.0, TestFramework.Config 0.4.0 and TestFramework.Azure 0.5.0; ConfigureDockerAzureCosmosEmulator() is AddDockerAzure(), and a Service Bus topology must be described with ConfigureServiceBusTopology or the run is refused while it is planned. BREAKING - renamed as in TestFramework.Azure: UseStorageAccount, UseCosmosDb, DockerStorageAccountDefinition, DockerCosmosDbDefinition, DockerSqlDatabaseDefinition, FunctionAppStorageAccountBinding, FunctionAppCosmosDbBinding, the Used*Identifiers lists, and the overrides QueueName, TableName and RequiresSession; the Use* bindings take a binding record instead of optional names. DockerAzureEnvironment hands each run its own instance, so read the used identifiers from run.Environment after a run.",
